ission of my vtuber Spidershii and my sweet moth friend Merri together! I want a drawing where we're both sitting and facing each other, Spidershii has a moth in her hand, and Merri has a spider in her hand! Maybe have them in a forest~\n\nHere's a description of Merri's character too! Merri Mellow as a character is a sweet but introverted magical mothlady! She's very, wholesome, but with a little bit of a gremlin side that comes out around friends especially. She loves nature, plants, and animals and also has a witchy/supernatural side to her. Her favorite kinds of animals are bugs and cryptids! She herself is a moth that can take on a humanlike appearance.\n\n\nThank you so much for considering! I'll be using this drawing for my socials like Twitter/ Twitch! \n\nHere is Spidershii: https://sta.sh/226j533zizh2?edit=1\nAnd Merri: https://sta.sh/2af7conm89x?edit=1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@shirana_iko/works/197", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/47406d0f/uploads/origins/8921165f-debb-47c8-af16-76e03ef3937f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f82c29f72e754a82c6d5127a126fda3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/47406d0f/uploads/origins/8921165f-debb-47c8-af16-76e03ef3937f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f82c29f72e754a82c6d5127a126fda3, https://si.imgix.net/47406d0f/uploads/origins/8921165f-debb-47c8-af16-76e03ef3937f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e3fd229d047aa4759171b9e09c2d147 2x, https://si.imgix.net/47406d0f/uploads/origins/8921165f-debb-47c8-af16-76e03ef3937f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b24a048e1299c53944a928877c9cdf7b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Shirana! I am here again with another commission request! I would like a commission of my new designed vtuber Spidershii and my friend Pieminster together! I would like a drawing whe